        "created_at": "2016-02-29T01:28:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not higher, but I'll be thrilled if the Sentinel Comics Roleplaying Game Kickstarter goes HALF this well:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/johnwickpresents/7th-sea-second-edition\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/johnwickpresents/7th-sea-second-edi…</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I just think it's funny how Christopher pops in on the thread that started out all about the furutre of the company with something only relavent to a side discussion, and no new input whatsoever about the main topic. &nbsp;Not ironic funny or anything, like actual ha ha funny.</p>",
